## A component in `.rocci`

```roc
import Html

@component CounterCard = |{ count }| {
    <div class="counter-card">
        <h3>Counter: {Num.toStr(count)}</h3>
        <button data-on-click="/increment">+1</button>
    </div>
}
```

See [Quickstart](/docs/getting-started/quickstart/) to run this locally, or [Guides](/docs/guides/build-a-component/) for the next implementation steps.
